- The pending divorce;
- Any updated net worth or liquid net worth;
- Any changed risk tolerance;
- Any liquidity needs;
- Any analysis of alternatives;
- Any basis for recommending a concentrated speculative position.

That is inconsistent with prudent brokerage supervisory and compliance practices.

