Thomas likely violated:

- SEC Regulation Best Interest, especially the Care Obligation;
- FINRA Rule 2111 suitability principles, to the extent applicable;
- FINRA Rule 2090 “Know Your Customer” principles, because he failed to use reasonable diligence to know essential facts about the customer before making the recommendation;
